NotProton licensing
===================

NotProton has a complex licensing situation. The bulk of the project is licensed
under GPLV3.

The parts that are modifications of Valve code are licensed under the license
that Valve released them under.

lsteamclient is licensed under the Steamworks SDK License, see
https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton/blob/proton_11.0/lsteamclient/LICENSE

steam-shim is a port of steam_helper from Proton 9.0, which Valve released under
BSD-3-Clause.

Steam-shim compiles against Steamworks SDK headers. Those headers are licensed
under the Steamworks SDK license whenever they are used.

It also compiles against OpenVR and Wine headers, which are BSD-3-Clause and
LGPL-V2, respectively.

The app bundle embeds Sparkle. Automatic upstream updates are disabled in this
SteamGPTK fork; releases are distributed separately. Sparkle is
MIT licensed, see
https://github.com/sparkle-project/Sparkle/blob/2.10.0/LICENSE

These third party files carry their original notices from the project authors:

  steam-shim/jsoncpp.cpp             JsonCpp, public domain / MIT (header)
  steam-shim/json/json.h             JsonCpp, public domain / MIT (header)
  steam-shim/json/json-forwards.h    JsonCpp, public domain / MIT (header)
  vendor/cJSON.c                     cJSON, MIT (header)
  vendor/cJSON.h                     cJSON, MIT (header)

SteamGPTK fork additions (2026-10-15)
====================================

SteamGPTK is a community fork of NotProton, not an Apple or Valve product.
Its Wine 11 installer, local GPTK import, UI adaptations and profile-path fixes
remain under the project GPL-3.0 license. Upstream authors and component
licenses are retained. The standalone base is commit
5b8d18683b619b66390be8cbcffc1fbf47e45971.

Runtime setup also draws on the mac-windows-gaming project by Xipzer:
https://github.com/Xipzer/mac-windows-gaming

Sikarugir Wine engines and support libraries are downloaded separately from
Sikarugir-App/Engines and Sikarugir-App/Wrapper at pinned checksums.
Apple GPTK/D3DMetal is supplied by the user from Apple's download and is not
included in the repository or app archive. Apple's terms apply to those files.

Dobby is statically linked into the NotProton module (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/jmpews/Dobby/tree/5dfc8546954ce3b3198132ab13fddb89ee92cdd7
